      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7803b0e976d94681b6ea6278edfe3bdaf7ab915f338901301c9e13a4d0df99d",
      "text": "20 / 25",
      "hash": "d9dac96e77be5af16a8c86439f427089ca3145523cfcddc554833c9427812f7d"
    },
    {
      "id": "f38d592375d962b656a8fab24f02dc1802b14dd05a0bcf4371add58b21fcd687",
      "text": "AI Skills for Real Engineers · 3 min read",
      "hash": "a5f14afae9e74fd646bb5b49c3d7fe2d7ca23954af2845899f8faf10f3503d22"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d1759ba0406871f3df72f47474bf967e9ad0ecab10ec6080087f87b99be8148",
      "text": "Ask the agent to say that again, in plain English.",
      "hash": "f97ef98c98295b553e6307da02b88fd340d206924528abab09a08aa495568032"
    },
    {
      "id": "73bcf1c7b604cda08606f2021dd45d7743edeb4d93896a0ddbe906e36d1e98a7",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "73692033984b26af089845d7f23a91dedead7abd68368b15ee5221959ee9f235",
      "text": "Subscribe",
      "hash": "cc0e38da9c41790bffef1b88af32d39ac285edce93da766810edc237cb2f1625"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5d64a486c613c52c5debec71ce555f2c93c7de064ed42a92d615e6c59ecf2a5",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "44aad95cdd1315f40ea5d28c2058ab3e79026f59835ac186d0bbfd10a8b434a7",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f3f00b04128663a74e1e8221063667eb64550de0cd1ff20eded246a67d9cba4",
      "text": "Next page",
      "hash": "c08ac736a5e29c291b681cbdc15f06901a735f28d2e04645b92cf331861cb8c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "8d0c79fb34c8f1630c87e86bf100ca0a564aadf2e678f0eb1d4172025f3861c2",
      "text": "Install this skill",
      "hash": "ad6eda7c3cb590a0fb06d5b5aa977e1a677ec8a778f30877f6afba0e712cabf3"
    },
    {
      "id": "324a5cdc26135f9d76b933f708758281664fd2df5435ac98ed8ffd26ef89c8d4",
      "text": "Then type",
      "hash": "ed734a13400e150b583a1043fa1f39714f4a6ba2cc5cc20f63f230c8507d839c"
    },
    {
      "id": "23824e1717f2389b9336e785bbf083fd3c1d1a912e2e7e802c237770192cbb94",
      "text": "in your coding agent.",
      "hash": "efea7ec4bbe4c91be662badc966e5cfe7955830ab75a606bca954737bdb999c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "c533f06d6080d559049a14dc1dfc6c88bec07eb092c10a09cbf5a481526ac0d1",
      "text": "Source",
      "hash": "0e570ca6fabe24f94e52c1833f3ffd25567022beb826fa16891f3322051bc221"
    },
    {
      "id": "2545516c692cb5fc0bc035ed475dcdfb961442dadd60bd5be090db91d87f0c73",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "d5a182f8f678c6b9c90eb52ada6c77be71a66fdbd854adf6d33a284d4bdfe9b5",
      "text": "What it does",
      "hash": "c74ea9dc9cd25b589a92e54a735d3900245dc7b30676952d536612677550ce36"
    },
    {
      "id": "08b87bfcf2edafda59d48cfa2755649e152558be5e5b49b69e17cc96ade753af",
      "text": "When to reach for it",
      "hash": "b6407702c9460d3edb23484dd6db20593ff469a794d8fcdd26340d6cbb483e67"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b306a98ec93502b92b908ad4ca37e606b19eccf3c0c69622f40531c40227485",
      "text": "The name is the mechanism",
      "hash": "7a56ff1a05806ff6335b0c17662ef3a8b4560feff1be0bb86a1a153aed74c571"
    },
    {
      "id": "79f80c38e9f71952fa217b42625d3816a2bb5c6b757fc4b1ede7e38d1488c2f6",
      "text": "It plugs into the language you already have",
      "hash": "ca1287f4c5f2a9c043f232fd76eb4db6279a4f258db0414d191e839c094c2495"
    },
    {
      "id": "432f48bff64eb3232367b1ba683bdfa22e82e0c5d7bb63cf75b602db2f6e0c0c",
      "text": "It's working if",
      "hash": "39277692e5fc01dbbfc92b8fe9dbaad0bb2ff3fb56af050adaa31810cdf4bac6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2328f05cfcf3f5eef3a2d7cab93d1d016b83662cc53f83a4c35b23409a9c68ad",
      "text": "Where it fits",
      "hash": "f895e63320934fe16a50ff39692a90c084868ec6ff756d08a971b42f9f0242f4"
    },
    {
      "id": "5929e594c6778b1c6f9d6e45c0a20d071a91316d3ea6b560a61eec0516d51485",
      "text": "Related reading",
      "hash": "89c21c36ad5ffbab7b05ced367c46013c8d7b8ddf53a8b9739b7b2545f78abee"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7ab568a524f5d297df1ccb51854e9c7a65d5f73b962c6322a43509972b7d804",
      "text": "is what you type when a message didn't land. The",
      "hash": "09b61e30c80b6650f7cb221593b276f33826c7458b92a3be598834066eaba5f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b1dcdc36d967e9f47dec940d23a8ace488ac9e468f6bcc7820e40d9e2b35655",
      "text": "then re-pitches what it just said. It adds the context you were missing, writes in plain English, and uses the vocabulary from your project's",
      "hash": "96d362dcd21fa89c81428b41ef896ca59062df1ff76b51ce50f2e33742c48863"
    },
    {
      "id": "996ee45a3d4f9756532bffe508ad1ee5d17696da29d7f2dcff86be76589e89a5",
      "text": "The skill is three lines long. That is the design, not an unfinished draft. Skills that fight verbosity fail by growing: a four-hundred-line concision skill still leaves the",
      "hash": "ade0316ca7c7ae2c16e74131947bdc72d882e0c7355d67a7e7fdfb8df51f67e1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a355b26c6d47c5d4fcce80bc280d0976dd88f2ea03da52ba00496d7e152370d5",
      "text": "verbose, because the model reads the volume, not the plea. This one carries a single precise leading word and nothing else.",
      "hash": "aa8632dac6d689fd3cbd3cbca4fa0f343d0292896ad4681529a598000c34a410"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9db8704c3fc60b6dd41faf4282134187402f166129dcb64def39d1b0a918adb",
      "text": "You invoke it by typing",
      "hash": "50d2ccb3219e2ec8fcd3d2b8b1903c730023cb118d50c24971f6a7fbe3b6f099"
    },
    {
      "id": "60300d3e9e603c8b7ccfbef0d4f84005ce8363524cce372d169d8738e17321e9",
      "text": ". The agent will not reach for it on its own, and it shouldn't. Only you know when you stopped following.",
      "hash": "a47d48d226ee472e78a4ba181ede960b145985a3190d38274f068dbdce553a30"
    },
    {
      "id": "5386d377a10dfe63c7d47039dd8192179b18b5a7709e2fe1267d856d66a7344c",
      "text": "Use it the second you notice you're skimming. The agent has drifted into jargon it invented, stacked five acronyms, or explained a decision whose premise you never saw. It fixes the conversation you're already in. To stop the jargon arriving at all, use",
      "hash": "5ebb2d432823ef6f9bb3dc9b3e8947a5dc0984ce27d638b38b4ec0d1479602de"
    },
    {
      "id": "79ecbde3f45c450b56b939eed8e1f0d0843730683892bbc0794fd877555c1417",
      "text": ", which builds the shared language upfront.",
      "hash": "4cd7927b156cd0ddfcbd705c97bc2f05a87e91c64abc51c3666fe53efd482d1a"
    },
    {
      "id": "ff3740a351d2543dc4b2c7954811f4d7f26778ce1926b1231552e39ce39ed59d",
      "text": "The leading word is",
      "hash": "43acea7c189950a419d4021be1a05f369723f871e968ab6b290256de870cf1eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "be3cf0a796b3a81f7fe1dace59421148b866645a589cba83ee7221e0af9c3dfb",
      "text": ". \"Be concise\" is an instruction about the agent's output, and the model obeys it by clipping words and losing you further.",
      "hash": "0f20e79082475e10076a3509879e1620ee65042e069089ae9203945bc49e0afd"
    },
    {
      "id": "3bd5ab9316b3256244b54e295f8e25028cd3f2fbf9d69caa13edc5cc94c633dd",
      "text": "Wait",
      "hash": "26b83994dca8b4b483edc45464ba07a5bde05cb7e6c5c61bb2e66da9d1e15fc7"
    },
    {
      "id": "d05281c902f058599dfd99f49f20ed12cf6a0aef7eb24224af73462e2cd28604",
      "text": "is about",
      "hash": "d6d2c3442fa0541a0d1ad29dbcb149d2f3e1c9acde0c01493806a94174659637"
    },
    {
      "id": "03ac8bf9c92fe0dab85178535fe1d13bc7aa5e51ed10325b9b4b898f3fec6ed2",
      "text": "state. It says comprehension failed here. An agent that hears \"be brief\" writes telegrams. An agent that hears \"wait, you lost me\" backs up and explains.",
      "hash": "a35b1e07d8fb782eeba88be17f6fc77c64aedede130febe1e36ca4880a7af1a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4e5c6e6c4a14b664511b1c2fed86ed2ab5aae31058b3f30311124cd4d1687d6",
      "text": "That difference is the whole skill. Every popular fix for verbosity names the",
      "hash": "660918da31faa8767af4f2e1ec4e35da8197f30fa1003bade97b0b32d4036aea"
    },
    {
      "id": "6833bb39a4db1674be39dfdc2798ae3efcf7048977ef24e1f4dd4b89e62ccb25",
      "text": ". The model over-corrects into a caveman register that is shorter and no clearer. Naming the",
      "hash": "47d779e1864d1c2d345ce2f4eea38d1c4d2e0c29af3f3253265a7155ff032146"
    },
    {
      "id": "981a49e8bc060891341e8f092b966881ccec03150fbf63bb4cd27408d756912c",
      "text": "asks for both halves at once: fewer words",
      "hash": "3aebb7974a30b518eb6542c50e2c37da251282d66f6a9d2a2584dfe6cca98499"
    },
    {
      "id": "f40af3842b36bcf29f34ef899f328651284d0ab03ab4690669b7bbe011699814",
      "text": "the context you were missing.",
      "hash": "329b8cc5f86f11cd5fb83cfefc5a6baafe24e8f9548927e82561c430e5927978"
    },
    {
      "id": "45c0d88555254c278108cbf91c18abc7dae658fa31394e80a6fafc060d337612",
      "text": "The skill says re-pitch",
      "hash": "749b7f03e2a12d136cc4a9cce1a4120b9ee6719458cbb69f620da012fc1d5508"
    },
    {
      "id": "73f1243a19eabdd19fb87c651fbe0f82666b5195bee00109e5b051fa7a3f6645",
      "text": ", not \"that last message\". What lost you is usually bigger than one paragraph, so the agent decides how far back to go.",
      "hash": "733475903a55a1170809be020fc504b2a04c488929e335389e7b47baeb6a2f94"
    },
    {
      "id": "d7c5b81cfc958711d396e71c74ecc8dd064db8bd88ae0b8590accf8ee53454f9",
      "text": "The body reuses the leading words already in your global",
      "hash": "c0cba67719093c704ce2b6b6e7bde0e7937b2733da9ac38d6c4ac997d1c6d516"
    },
    {
      "id": "ac3e13372a0ce3b66b92a3f60d7969c3453c314b99c0c23d14dd5138b2b6f33d",
      "text": "and your project's",
      "hash": "eeca683d6a50b3bb2087f628520f42e9f6622c06e6a732a9176aa6c16dc19ace"
    },
    {
      "id": "d23acb7b70c9ff6cc623680263d1b1b546ec0e67134f977030e489f56358994c",
      "text": ". ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English sets the register. The ubiquitous language supplies the nouns. The skill,",
      "hash": "e947df10ec10134bb4dde2836a8b76597a23ae65006ce09d5e25a27e9865b02d"
    },
    {
      "id": "dcb083824fe7ebc30d93c3c570d2b7c5896d53231465fdba06bfc50c5fee84c6",
      "text": "reach for the same",
      "hash": "8647b8dac765dec2c0886e4dee7545d435d44d270caf678f2acd51d0da4ca6f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "34218a6947692992892ddc2e5898e870a9001909dbbcc157f7827f9760be65d3",
      "text": ", so invoking it is not a new instruction. It is a reminder of one the agent already agreed to.",
      "hash": "cedf1c54896c1a771c6d8a5a2f44a238a64a76e049fecc6aadd472a5a6f9c587"
    },
    {
      "id": "4aa1dc60a194970346691d84731bf3a608fd5796db6e75e2b22d43c119652322",
      "text": "If you have no",
      "hash": "624c40e98a7138d13fa5d8904d42b6ecd6f224fbe64a2e5f53b4ada4ee3a7f52"
    },
    {
      "id": "873d3c1a63b07f6fd1df92def890f2242b4a33feb6efc907173700c352a24f48",
      "text": ", the skill still works. You lose only the domain-vocabulary half.",
      "hash": "41823d067ce4fd6c631576fea0f95137d1f6dc518290d0f67d73b942d7672ee0"
    },
    {
      "id": "f680b09e3b9c5f26a77d56caff6bbf325eb1e0e310227d877bfb9ea0e59bbd4c",
      "text": "The re-pitch is",
      "hash": "a491d033ea3cd287d065fc1e01523a2b7743f1a37f17f18500b19b6a5f701944"
    },
    {
      "id": "7eb397ac0a2e57d56cc02a37ae69facf4a609b3882bfa681e4c58b63b41de2cc",
      "text": "shorter and clearer",
      "hash": "701a57b36b807c295a0b4a778318e6abd8158c8dab41bbf9055b8be9129db77b"
    },
    {
      "id": "16f53fb735e77293d77837f7b938c5472acd8d9037c897b76fd396c27c08bba7",
      "text": ", not shorter and blunter.",
      "hash": "3fceadd049343c40efb4b4b3672d11c9831b466a865845945139406fcfdf5d0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "1500ff7e85b56574c590e04cdcd45d170121221588da9db32818bdbe73e9d787",
      "text": "It adds the premise you were missing, instead of only deleting words.",
      "hash": "3d866ee041d5f6cdf54297231105ec6005d7ce5d8eb20d5f568bd26d08817b7a"
    },
    {
      "id": "751fd3c65dbad016805d0259c5c15de5affb6b60b7ef8bd2d79421b40afa23c4",
      "text": "Project nouns replace invented ones. The terms in your",
      "hash": "9017f511c76b71acd4fed371f92032409356de774236065b62a0e21379cfdc69"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef4efc9a9c99509eacd6a89ac6ff4afbc649baf259a6e881b303cf11c4b04660",
      "text": "come back.",
      "hash": "6acaf4d672eed52ce8636fbd2cdab6b082831dab5b253d658b5b1803e0dca987"
    },
    {
      "id": "5dc53f3cba4a9928ad37ef9a17b7bef9c5ee0a41f411f2cd81aacfe3e3601ad6",
      "text": "You can use it twice in a row, and it does not degrade into terseness.",
      "hash": "907cc25254319bb71840130a2d988ce0b6898478a64b00e4d33ed70779f02f87"
    },
    {
      "id": "1ea96ff698ab8825dbbf379cfcdf5641350988e25fb51e4a30d0d6048aaabb7a",
      "text": "You can use",
      "hash": "7e7d2669195bc241a4bc2a2365c28de574d6beab8d4c1febc5561ac354f0e8f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb34265f3f574847f3df7b45ec97cc28684fecbc98253fef45c3c036e765c9e9",
      "text": "at any point, in any conversation, inside any other skill. It repairs one message after the fact. The real cure is a shared language agreed upfront, and that is",
      "hash": "64c37efc08b5bdf3fa553aacc546714245d53515b1b75b4e7e27b6eb58aa049c"
    },
    {
      "id": "09b603259b838d2ef2e42aba2e717b991ece17f90f4a9c28e836ec2b16fb0e29",
      "text": ": a",
      "hash": "2704eb3a3de68aa5b8165158d19ccd99dbb86c0d46672793fc30b9b5836f5357"
    },
    {
      "id": "28c2cd1d5ac63b3a93591e8fdca78a2a79057cc74511cb2f0a8ab8e47be34443",
      "text": "session that runs",
      "hash": "6c2d7573aaa53f8c59f06b1b218938df31d0841a314941e1e61feaa02baebfb9"
    },
    {
      "id": "6e4e39d4402009adbb8fb0a82c7c7062984e01b6c069eeab9292d4d619224ca1",
      "text": "as it goes, so the words you both use land in your",
      "hash": "9f1b6f01eea369f9e921612b0287d559cbf5e58fbdaaeeb00fd4d495bca50ca3"
    },
    {
      "id": "91d33631b8e4a3bf0152479c6f1a9d77a8853658405f23d81630837770912a37",
      "text": ". If you're unsure which skill fits the moment,",
      "hash": "eb211ccf9c0a645e239a9b9fbdcfbd52974a3ba0ccdc9266a4a7830594abb7a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "7930fe2676116c8db658763c63dbbded86aca7e029289ec0823b685cb662ebb0",
      "text": "routes you.",
      "hash": "7ab0ed124c45755dcf8314c61ea1bf3f8c9926f3cf622e8d67e880128523bfad"
    },
    {
      "id": "541d28a3af8e7eefcee0bb622cc651869743a1897c3364d639b0163f05e45365",
      "text": "AI Hero · Free email course",
      "hash": "5f5fa5b2781f6c651c6c614fe8c6af4c0543e64fb7820832510cff5c66fecef0"
    },
    {
      "id": "97b3b21549181ad29936a417ff8992c32bd4bc93c2e39800c7e67f51b710f5a7",
      "text": "You have the skill. Now build the workflow around it.",
      "hash": "1f8c6e3c70e6ee55ea65c0a7163ba365614d1e9ef6e5dfa1610cc4ae4db71f24"
    },
    {
      "id": "156b69222e144c568869b615d6f71d4858c191952a0595fb52ebac35d5f4d192",
      "text": "Install the skills you want, then use the free course to put them in order: seven lessons, from clarifying the work to reviewing the diff. Go as fast as you want.",
      "hash": "0cea17052284f2c2f28d7e1987799139dfef9d260c78bc88123b1c421c4488cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "d7c91f786a15c2d44d4c157fa5b37c5a36d347f61d0e748b367b29254644109e",
      "text": "Where this fits",
      "hash": "1fee08543383d96f7b1df37709d40ce798415b59399107ef9f0591d5852e71ee"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1b3e0bdb26f90c08db995214675853b2bbd0a2b3f5217a0ab16c0a7ad0d6e21",
      "text": "Share on X",
